---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../utils/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Prasad Vaidya, a technical architect working on SaaS platforms, backend systems, and AI products."
>
  <div class="container page">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      I'm Prasad Vaidya, a technical architect. I've spent my career designing
      software systems across product and engineering teams: SaaS platforms, backend
      services, and lately AI product architecture.
    </p>
    <p>
      The part of the work I care most about is keeping systems understandable. I
      prefer simple designs that scale through clarity, chosen against real business
      constraints rather than fashion. In practice that means writing down context,
      making trade-offs visible, and building feedback loops so teams can move
      without surprises.
    </p>
    <p>
      Current interests: AI-enabled products, developer productivity, personal
      knowledge systems, and the road from technical leadership to independent
      product building.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside software I'm midway through a long health transformation, learning
      jazz guitar, and curious about filmmaking. The common thread is that I treat
      all of it as systems: small experiments, honest measurement, patience.
    </p>

    <section id="connect">
      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        The best places to find me are{" "}
        <a class="link" href={site.socials.github}>GitHub</a> for code and{" "}
        <a class="link" href={site.socials.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a> for everything
        else. I enjoy conversations about architecture, AI products, and the founder
        side of engineering, so say hello.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  p {
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
